1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Open Horizon from Finder or click its menu bar icon.
The cursor starts in the task field.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Type a task that names your project.
Here, Horizon matches Harborline in the local records.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Check the topic and the dated records.
The preview is exactly what Copy will use, not an AI answer.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Click Copy to put the preview on your clipboard.
You choose where to paste it. Nothing is sent automatically.

